        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-legend" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Legend&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• Solid grey: a request, client → server. Dashed orange: tunnel opened outbound. Dashed purple: background sync.&lt;br&gt;• Dotted grey: an object reference (owns, bounds, datasource), not traffic.&lt;br&gt;• Large dashed frame: cluster or SaaS. Small frame: namespace or functional group. Stack: one per app.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; request step · &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt; background step · TCP 80: listening port on the server.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1520" width="480" height="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-steps" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#059669&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Request path · data plane&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; A user opens &amp;lt;app&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;.3istor.com: the project&amp;#39;s Cloudflare tunnel ends TLS.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; The project connector relays the request to the project gateway.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; The gateway runs the OIDC login of the route, then sends the request to the app.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="560" y="1520" width="620" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-bg" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ea580c&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Background&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt; &amp;lt;p&amp;gt;-tunnel opens the tunnel outbound: nothing enters the cluster from the Internet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt; Argo CD polls the registry record and generates the project&amp;#39;s Applications. &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt; It reads each app&amp;#39;s values from its repo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;D&lt;/span&gt; Argo CD applies &amp;lt;p&amp;gt;-bootstrap and every app Application to the target cluster API: destination.name = spec.targetCloud (on-prem: https://kubernetes.default.svc; clouds: the cluster-&amp;lt;cloud&amp;gt; Secret).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="560" y="1740" width="620" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-made" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4f46e5&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Who creates what&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;CMP:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; the registry record (targetCloud, apps, environments, features) and the vmauth user project-&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Terraform project-bootstrap&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; (in the CMP pod): Keycloak groups and realm &amp;lt;p&amp;gt;, Vault mount project-&amp;lt;p&amp;gt; with its role on kubernetes (on-prem) or kubernetes-&amp;lt;cloud&amp;gt;, the Cloudflare tunnel and DNS, the Grafana org.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Terraform k3s-gitops-app&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;, per app: the app repo, its OIDC client in realm &amp;lt;p&amp;gt;, its Vault secrets and role, its DNS record.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;cnp-project-base&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;, by Argo CD: everything in &amp;lt;p&amp;gt;-system, the app namespaces and the ingress policy. Tenants cannot edit the policy (AppProject blacklist).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="1520" width="520" height="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-access" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#e11d48&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Who sees what&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Argo CD:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; project-&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;-admins and -members get the project roles of AppProject &amp;lt;p&amp;gt;; &amp;lt;p&amp;gt;-platform holds what tenants cannot touch.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Apps:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; realm &amp;lt;p&amp;gt; brokers the 3istor login; an app can be limited to groups with ingress.allowedGroups (empty by default).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Data:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Grafana org &amp;lt;p&amp;gt; reads metrics through vmauth (its namespaces only) and logs from Loki tenant &amp;lt;p&amp;gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
